  "content": [
    {
      "text": "In Jonah 4:6–10, gourd refers to the castor-oil plant, Ricinus communis or palma-Christi, a plant of very rapid growth; in 2 Kgs. 4:38–40 gourd refers to the colocynth, which has vine-shaped leaves, hence is called “wild vine.”",
